+For machine-readable diagnostics, use `validate_profile.py --json PROFILE.json`.
+It emits one JSON object on stdout and no stderr, with exactly `schema_version`
+(integer `1`), `valid`, `issues` and `scope` (`"structure-only"`). Each issue has
